window.products.push({"id":885009,"name":"Vintage London Bridge Railway Station Clock","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/412x+WJNPGL._AC_.jpg","description":"The London Bridge Railway Station is the central railway terminus in the Southwark London Borough and has one of the oldest railway stations in the world (the Main Line Station) Originally opened as the London Station in 1836, this reproduction railway clock provides old world charm for railroad buffs and lovers of England and of London Measures 16-in H x 13-1/2-in L x 3-in W Has dual clock faces (on both sides) and measure 9-1/2-in Diameter Mount on wall or post. Independently controlled movements each require 1 AA battery (not included)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/412x+WJNPGL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Upper Deck","source_asin":"B00F9INBS6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-885009","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00F9INBS6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00F9INBS6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":885010,"name":"Hardware Resources Double 35-Quart Trash Bin Cabinet Pullout System - 2 Black Waste, Recycling Bins - Easy-Installation Polished Chrome Ball-Bearing G","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":196.1,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61WEjK8n4AS._SL1362_.jpg","description":"Having trouble keeping trash bins hidden from plain sight? Nearly every room of your home, especially the kitchen, needs a designated container to hold accumulated garbage. Unfortunately, waste bins often tend to take up valuable floor space. Not to mention, they often look cluttered in a corner, sticking out like a sore thumb. This is avoidable with the right tools and supplies to put an efficient waste management system in place — all with the goal of keeping garbage baskets off the floors and out of sight, but still within reach. Change the way you organize household waste with the Hardware Resources Double 35-Quart Trash Bin Cabinet Pullout System. Our chrome polished waste management system keeps your wastebaskets safely hidden behind closed doors. This not only helps minimize unsightly clutter but also helps prevent any foul odors from getting out in the open. The mechanism is simple enough to be installed without professional help. It comes with the necessary hardware — four screws for the bottom — as well as an optional door mounting kit that you can attach to a cabinet door that can act as a handle. Easy to pull out like a drawer, the trash bins will be readily accessible to you. Our pull-out garbage bin sets also come with matching 35-qt. Hardware Resources trash bins. They come in the perfect size for the wire base. This way, you won’t have to take measurements or deal with mismatched containers. More reasons to equip your kitchen with this pull-out system: 🚮 A trash bin capacity of 17.50 gallons 🚮 DIMENSIONS (WxDxH): 13-15/16\"x22\"x19\" 🚮 Sleek and shiny polished chrome finish 🚮 Also ideal for recycling, composting 🚮 Also suitable for the bathroom, bedroom, or office It’s time to make your life easier when it comes to waste management. Add the Hardware Resources Double 35-Quart Trash Bin Cabinet Pullout System to your cart NOW!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61WEjK8n4AS._SL1362_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hardware Resources","source_asin":"B098GGGFMC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-885010","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B098GGGFMC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B098GGGFMC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
