window.products.push({"id":885127,"name":"Christmas Tree Topper,Christmas Tree Toppers with Rotating Snowflakes LED Projector,Tree Toppers Christmas Decorations,3D Gold Star Tree Topper for Xm","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71rOvVtETzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Upgraded Sparkling Stars Christmas Tree Topper: Christmas tree topper will Create magic and shining stars for the top of the Christmas tree. The star tree topper adopts 3D hollow design with sparkling powder. The upgraded snowflake LED projector is inside of tree topper which project more clear and bright snowflakes effects, adding sparkle to your Christmas tree. Built-in Rotating LED Snowflake Projector Light: Star tree topper built-in magic LED rotating projector. The Christmas tree topper will project many floating snowflakes onto your ceiling and increase the Christmas vibe.It looks like snow flurries falling down from the sky, making your Christmas more special. All pattern spin and move on the ceiling, which create a strong festive atmosphere. Universal Size and Easy Installation: Size of the Christmas tree topper is 8.85 * 9.92 *2.5 inches. It's very suitable for Christmas trees of various sizes. The 10ft long plug cord is easy to connect the tree topper to power. Just install the base of the topper on the top of the Christmas tree with suitable angle. Connect it to power. The projector will display dynamic snowflakes on the ceiling. The snowflake area can be changed by adjusting the distance between the tree topper and the ceiling. Best Christmas Tree Decoration: Star tree topper is suitable for decorating houses, parties or bars. The Christmas tree topper light brings you a perfect Christmas. It's the best gift for family or friends, especially for children. It can also be used as an ideal choice for children's rotating LED night light projector. Service : Safe to use with UL certification. We are professional in all kinds of parties, we strive for your experience. Any problem just email us, we always stand by for your 100% satisfied service.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71rOvVtETzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sainyuan","source_asin":"B09966QBXL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-885127","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09966QBXL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09966QBXL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
