window.products.push({"id":885330,"name":"Clothing Racks for Hanging Clothes,Heavy Duty Clothes Rack,Garment Rack,Adjustable Closet Rods for Hanging Clothes,Portable Closets for Hanging Clothe","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":56.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81uHyBVSxhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"➤➤STURDY AND DURABLE: Fokyfok closet system are made of high-quality iron, The vertical pole diameter is 1.26\" (Heavy Duty), Each horizontal rod can hold 120 lbs, Each folding clothes rack can hold 30 lbs，the total bearing capacity is 300 lbs.Even if the whole wardrobe rack is full of thick winter clothes, the hanging clothes rack can be Stable and will not fall ➤➤HEIGHT&WIDTH&DOUBLE RODS SPACING ARE ADJUSTABLE （Adjustable range： horizontal rods is 27.5\"—47.2\" vertical rods is 43.3\"—122\"）, two horizontal rods and beside Folding hanger rack can be adjusted up and down.Make full use of the ceiling height,even with extra long dresses, you don't worry about the dress touching the floor . The size of folding hanger rack is 12.4\",they can be folded up 90°.It is important to note that：The horizontal bar can be adjusted in length, but there is no tension, only the vertical bar has tension ➤➤SPACE-SAVING&NO DRILLING: no need to drill or glue on the ceiling and floor, the upper and lower double rods make full use of vertical space, saving floor space.Fokyfok clothes hanging rack occupy 1/3 of the area of traditional free standing closet , but the capacity is double of the traditional wardrobe.The size of packaging is only 44\"X5\"X6\", you can easily take it away when you move ➤➤PARTITIONED STORAGE, NEAT &CONVENIENT: You can save the tediousness of folding clothes, just hang the clothes in the four areas of the upper, lower, left, and right sides of the metal clothing rack according to the season or length, which is neat and convenient for you to quickly find clothes without making clothing messy . Both ends of the horizontal rod can be used to hang bags, scarves and hats ➤➤WIDE APPLICATION: Fokyfok open wardrobe can be used in any large and small spaces in the home, such as bedrooms, closets, balconies, living rooms, laundry rooms, walk-in cloakrooms, student dormitories and rental houses, clothing stores.Suitable for ceiling heights from 43.3\"-122\".Not recommended for use on suspended ceilings.Adjustable clothing rack need to stand on solid ceilings and floors that can bear weight","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81uHyBVSxhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fokyfok","source_asin":"B0BZ48VWGK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-885330","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BZ48VWGK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BZ48VWGK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":885331,"name":"8” Stainless Steel Vacu-Stack Chimney Cap TDW for Air Cooled Chimney Pipe","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":321.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41TUVvDpdZL._AC_.jpg","description":"Do you have wind-related chimney draft problems? This is the premier chimney cap for solving common, wind-related chimney draft issues for air cooled chimneys! Wind-induced downdrafts cause smoke to enter the home when tall trees, mountains, hills, or tall buildings are near. The Vacu-Stack chimney cap not only helps with draft issues, but it also protects the chimney from debris, animals, rain, and snow from entering the flue. Fits inside of your chimney pipe. Use the Vacu-Stack TDW chimney cap with double or triple wall air-cooled or air-insulated chimneys. Our new model is now leakproof because it is self-flashing. Manufactured with 304 stainless steel in the USA. Have questions about this product? Please ask, we're here to help you do-it-yourself!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41TUVvDpdZL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Rockford Chimney Supply","source_asin":"B01BT5PT3W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-885331","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01BT5PT3W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01BT5PT3W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":885332,"name":"Toland Home Garden 771277 Set of 2 Red Damask Winter Pillow Covers 12x18 Inch Christmas Outdoor Lumbar Indoor Decorative Throw Pillows","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71YE4p73fML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"You know and love our decorative art flags, now enjoy Toland Home Garden’s line of outdoor pillows! Our pillows are printed with the quality you’ve come to expect from Toland Home Garden and featuring the designs you’ve come to love. These pillows are constructed with 600 denier polyester and are double-stitched to ensure longevity and comfort. They are soft enough to enjoy relaxing on, durable, waterproof and built to last! The colorful designs will add the right amount of color to make your entertaining areas really pop! Available in two sizes; the 18” x 18” square pillow and the 12” x 19” lumbar pillow.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71YE4p73fML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Toland Home Garden","source_asin":"B084DX96V5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-885332","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B084DX96V5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B084DX96V5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
