window.products.push({"id":885717,"name":"16x30x1 Electrostatic Washable Permanent A/C Furnace Air Filter","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61f2UGVcd+L._AC_.jpg","description":"The 0.12 inch W.G. initial resistance of the SILVER 94 will perform best in systems configured with 1 square foot, or more, of filter area for each ton of air conditioning. Two layers of woven monofilament polypropylene with integral anti-microbial material provide 10 times more filtration than a disposable fiberglass filter. The deep loading center layer of non-woven polyester allows THE SILVER 94 to prolong the time between washings. Replaces standard 16x30x1 sized disposable filters. Standard filters are generally undercut 3/8 inch. The actual size of this filter is 15-5/8 x 29-5/8 x 7/8 These filters retail elsewhere for $89.99-$99.99. HOW ELECTROSTATIC FURNACE FILTERS WORK ELECTROSTATIC AIR FILTER cleans the air by using static electricity, a safe, naturally occurring phenomenon. An electrostatic charge is generated by air flowing through a maze of static prone fibers. Airborne particles are attracted and held by the static charge until released by washing. All Air Commander ELECTROSTATIC AIR FILTER contain an EPA registered anti-microbial material to inhibit mold and bacteria growth on the air filter surface. The air you breathe contains many irritants such as pollen, dust, bacteria, mold spores, pet dander and smoke. Most of these particles are smaller than one micron. Our ELECTROSTATIC FILTER is an effective and efficient way to reduce the number of these particles in your air. This unique characteristic improves air flow while providing maximum filtration. A necessity for allergy sufferers! This filter is designed to work in any central heating or air conditioning system. All filters come with Lifetime Air-Care warranty. Your satisfaction is 100% guaranteed!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61f2UGVcd+L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kilowatts Energy Center","source_asin":"B005LCVKJW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-885717","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B005LCVKJW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B005LCVKJW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
