window.products.push({"id":885787,"name":"THE WHITE CORMORANTS STANDING BY THE RED LUTOS - Chinese Painting. Painted by Original Artist. Museum Quality.Mounted On Scrolls for Hanging. Scroll S","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61lgA5eeB2L._AC_SL1014_.jpg","description":"Title:The white cormorants Standing by the Red Lutos Chinese Painting It is one of the oldest continuous artistic traditions in the world. Traditional painting involves essentially the same techniques as calligraphy and is done with a brush dipped in black or colored ink. The most popular materials on which are paper and silk. The finished work can be mounted on scrolls, such as hanging scrolls or hand scrolls. Traditional painting can also be done on album sheets, walls, lacquerware, folding screens, and other media. Tree Peony It is a very beautiful plant originating in China, which is one of the most popular subjects among Chinese Painting Artists. As the Chinese national flower it has other name \"Riches and honor flowers\", or \"Kilograms gold\" that indicates the flower is the symbol of happiness and good luck. Artists We promise that our paintings are painted by the original artists, who are members of China Artists Association. We refuse printing, pool quality workshop producing-line working style respect for the spirit of arts. Your Package Will Be Handled with Care All of our paintings are packed in durable tubes with air bubble film rolled up. Please be aware Since the paintings are totally made by hand, there is always a slight variation to the initial workpiece. There also possibly would be a tolerance of 0.5-1 inch in length or width. All of our Chinese Paintings are mounted on scrolls, which can be hanged immediately when they arrive. The size indicated in the description is the painting area. If you want to frame it ( as the second picture shows), just need to cut off the scrolls and leave suitable margin. Then frame your painting based on the actual size of the painting. It's easy to be framed by using a premade frame with glass from gift shops. You also could ask the owner of the shop to help.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61lgA5eeB2L._AC_SL1014_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Colorful Stream","source_asin":"B00YN3XKZM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-885787","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00YN3XKZM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00YN3XKZM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
