window.products.push({"id":885790,"name":"Geeki Tikis 18 ounce Ceramic Mug| Frankenstein Monster Boris Karloff| Green","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":34.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ee+YqOdZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"From an alternate Tiki reality that’s imbued with a relaxed “surf’s up” vibe, a humorous twist on the classic movie that birthed Frankenstein’s creature. Imagine an alternate universe where South Seas culture is the norm and everything’s filtered through a tropical, sunny sensibility, and you have Geeki Tiki’s take on the 18th century tale of humanity and man’s overreach. Plus, you also get a useful and amusing beverage mug. Talk about sweet pau pau!This Pacific Islander version of Dr. Victor Frankenstein’s creation kicks gloom and doom’s butt to pave the way for a fun and happy romp. Whether filled with your favorite coffee brew, or with different beverage at a beach party, you’ve got the “fun” part of functionality.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ee+YqOdZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Geeki Tikis","source_asin":"B072W9JVC7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-885790","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B072W9JVC7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B072W9JVC7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
